			"notes": "Ageratum 1.0.0 · NeoForge\n\n## What's Changed\n* Add script to turn GuideME guide into Ageratum guide by @TBPig in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/4\n* 支持渲染.snbt结构文件 by @TBPig in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/5\n* Update paths and refactor ItemLink handling by @TBPig in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/14\n* 将默认配置scale调整为2 by @TBPig in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/24\n* Fix sidebar scrolling issues and enhance guide interactions by @TBPig in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/27\n* Unify development dependencies for 1.21.1 统一 1.21.1 开发依赖 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/50\n* Fix guide container lifecycle 修复手册打开后的交易状态（1.21.1） by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/46\n* Add block inspection and dark textures 添加方块信息查看与深色贴图 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/51\n* fix(render): 同步 1.21 手册结构实体预览 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/53\n* Fix structure block entity inspection 补全结构方块实体配置信息 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/55\n* Add read-only structure GUI previews 添加结构原生只读界面浮窗 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/57\n* Fix handbook scrolling and list layout 修复手册滚动与列表排版 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/59\n* Update AnvilLib rendering 更新砧库依赖并适配渲染模块 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/61\n* [1.21.1] Share AnvilLib structure previews 共用砧库结构预览 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/63\n* [1.21.1] Adjust preview gestures 调整结构预览拖动按键与旋转方向 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/65\n* Update AnvilLib to 2.0.0 on 1.21.1 更新 1.21.1 砧库正式版依赖 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/69\n* Modernize handbook parsing and directory navigation on 1.21.1 重构 1.21.1 手册解析与目录跳转 by @WhereisFff in https://github.com/Anvil-Dev/Ageratum/pull/72\n* Port handbook zoom c